 },
 "integration": {
  "summary": "Set the MS/TP address, baud and device ID on the meter screens, then set system type (AV 2), CT size (AV 3) and system voltage (AV 6) to match the service. Trend total energy (AI 1) and real power (AI 2), and watch the alert BIs or AI 52.",
