    "why": "Average line-line voltage"
   },
   {
    "ref": "AI 8",
    "name": "Current_Avg",
    "why": "Average current, A"
   },
   {
    "ref": "AI 25",
    "name": "Frequency",
    "why": "Frequency, Hz"
   },
   {
    "ref": "AI 52",
    "name": "Alarm_Bitmap",
    "why": "All alert bits as one number"
   }
  ],
  "enable": null,
  "heartbeat": null,
  "remote_sensors": null,
  "setup": [
   "Device ID 1-4,193,999, set on the meter screens (ID1/ID2) or via Object_Identifier; factory default is a pseudo-random number 1,000,000-3,097,151.",
   "Max_Master writable 1-127 (default 127); Max_Info_Frames is 1.",
   "Set AV 5 PT ratio before AV 6 system voltage; AV 6 is line-line except for system type 10."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "Writes to AVs take up to about 2 s to validate; read Reliability before trusting an immediate read-back.",
   "Accumulators are floats, so resolution drops as they grow; reset them (AV 1) if resolution matters.",
   "Write the demand/log trigger codes to AV 1 no more often than every 10 s.",
   "No segmentation; max APDU 480."
  ]
 },
